LHS = \dfrac{1}{3} + \dfrac{1}{9} + \dfrac{1}{27} + \dots + \dfrac{1}{3^{k}} + \dfrac{1}{3^{k+1}}
= \dfrac{3^{k} - 1}{2(3^{k})} + \dfrac{1}{3^{k+1}}        (from step 2)
= \dfrac{3 \times (3^{k} - 1)}{3 \times 2(3^{k})} + \dfrac{2 \times 1}{2 \times 3^{k+1}}
= \dfrac{3^{k+1} - 3 + 2}{2(3^{k+1})}
= \dfrac{3^{k+1} - 1}{2(3^{k+1})} = RHS
